                <pb facs="0096" n="68" xml:id="pg68"/>

                <head>27. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On February 13, 1961, Ambassador Thompson
                    testified before the Senate Foreign Relations Committee for over 2 hours on
                    conditions in the Soviet Union, U.S.-Soviet relations, and Soviet policy around
                    the world. For a transcript of the proceedings, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Executive Sessions of the Senate Foreign Relations Committee (Historical
                        Series), 1961,</hi> pages 135-178.</p>
            </div>
